  "question": {
    "text": "A cubical solid aluminum <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>bulk</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>modulus</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>V</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>70</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>GPa</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;block has an edge length of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> on the surface of the earth. It is kept on the floor of a <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>km</mi></math>&nbsp;deep ocean. Taking the average density of water and the acceleration due to gravity to be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math> and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>, respectively, the change in the edge length of the block in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>mm</mi></math> is ________.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "0.24",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><mi>V</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><mi>V</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>P</mi><mi>B</mi></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>&#8467;</mi></mrow><mi>&#8467;</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>P</mi><mi>B</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>&#8467;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mfrac><mi>&#8467;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mfrac><mi>kg</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>70</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>9</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>&#8467;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>238</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>&#8467;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>238</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mm</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>24</mn></math></p>",
